uestions at /v1/decisions with calibrated probabilities and zero output tokens. Full multimodal decision architecture (~850M parameters, 32K reach); native vision and audio towers: Kai-2 target.","View all Hanzo models →","Use Kai (kai-1.8) via Hanzo AI","One API key. One call to POST /v1/decisions.","Get an API key","Browse All Models"],"links":["/models","/models/hanzo","#quickstart","/kai","https://github.com/hanzoai/kai","/benchmarks#leaderboard","/benchmarks#kai","https://hanzo.blog/2026-10-07-introducing-kai/","https://hanzo.blog/2026-10-25-your-ai-is-planning-to-kill-you/","https://platform.hanzo.ai/api-keys","/models/hanzo/kai"]}